"out of place, it's easy to <a href=\"%(move_messages_link)s\">move messages</"
"a>, <a href=\"%(rename_topics_link)s\">rename topics</a>, or even <a "
"href=\"%(move_channels_link)s\">move a topic to a different channel</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ne brini zbog savršenog naziva teme. Ako nešto nije na mjestu, lako je <a "
"href=\"%(move_messages_link)s\">premjestiti poruke</a>, <a href=\"%"
"(rename_topics_link)s\">preimenovati teme</a> ili čak <a href=\"%"
"(move_channels_link)s\">premjestiti temu u drugi kanal</a>."

