#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can [download](/apps/) the [mobile and desktop apps](/apps/).\n"
"Zulip also works great in a browser.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Možeš [preuzeti](/apps/) [mobilne i desktop aplikacije](/apps/).\n"
"Zulip izvrsno radi i u pregledniku.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"Go to [Profile settings](#settings/profile) to add a [profile picture](/help/"
"change-your-profile-picture)\n"
"and edit your [profile information](/help/edit-your-profile).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Idi na [Postavke profila](#settings/profile) da dodaš [profilnu sliku](/help/"
"change-your-profile-picture)\n"
"i urediš [podatke profila](/help/edit-your-profile).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can switch between [light and dark theme](/help/dark-theme), [pick your\n"
"favorite emoji set](/help/emoji-and-emoticons#change-your-emoji-set), "
"[change\n"
"your language](/help/change-your-language), and otherwise customize your "
"Zulip\n"
"experience in your [Preferences](#settings/preferences).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Možeš se prebacivati između [svijetle i tamne teme](/help/dark-theme), "
"[odabrati\n"
"omiljeni skup emojija](/help/emoji-and-emoticons#change-your-emoji-set), "
"[promijeniti\n"
"jezik](/help/change-your-language) i na drugi način prilagoditi svoje Zulip\n"
"iskustvo u [postavkama](#settings/preferences).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Channels organize conversations based on who needs to see them. For "
"example,\n"
"it's common to have a channel for each team in an organization.\n"
"\n"
"[Browse and subscribe to channels]({settings_link}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kanali organiziraju razgovore prema tome kome ih treba vidjeti. Primjerice,\n"
"uobičajeno je da svaki tim u organizaciji ima svoj kanal.\n"
"\n"
"[Pregledaj kanale i pretplati se]({settings_link}).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"[Topics](/help/introduction-to-topics) summarize what each conversation in "
"Zulip\n"
"is about. You can read Zulip one topic at a time, seeing each message in\n"
"context, no matter how many other conversations are going on.\n"
"\n"
"When you start a conversation, label it with a new topic. For a good topic "
"name,\n"
"think about finishing the sentence: “Hey, can we chat about…?”\n"
"\n"
"Check out [Recent conversations](#recent) for a list of topics that are "
"being\n"
"discussed.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"[Teme](/help/introduction-to-topics) sažimaju o čemu je svaki razgovor u "
"Zulipu.\n"
"Zulip možeš čitati jednu temu po jednu, videći svaku poruku u\n"
"kontekstu, bez obzira na to koliko drugih razgovora traje.\n"
"\n"
"Kad započneš razgovor, označi ga novom temom. Za dobar naziv teme\n"
"razmisli kako bi dovršio rečenicu: „Hej, možemo popričati o…?”\n"
"\n"
"Pogledaj [Nedavne razgovore](#recent) za popis tema o kojima se\n"
"trenutačno raspravlja.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"Zulip's [keyboard shortcuts](#keyboard-shortcuts) let you navigate the app\n"
"quickly and efficiently.\n"
"\n"
"Press `?` any time to see a [cheat sheet](#keyboard-shortcuts).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Zulip [tipkovnički prečaci](#keyboard-shortcuts) omogućuju ti brzo i\n"
"učinkovito kretanje kroz aplikaciju.\n"
"\n"
"Pritisni `?` bilo kada za [prečace](#keyboard-shortcuts).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can **format** *your* `message` using the handy formatting buttons, or "
"by\n"
"typing your formatting with Markdown.\n"
"\n"
"Check out the [cheat sheet](#message-formatting) to learn about spoilers, "
"global\n"
"times, and more.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Možeš **oblikovati** *svoju* `poruku` pomoću praktičnih gumba za oblikovanje "
"ili\n"
"tipkanjem Markdown oznaka.\n"
"\n"
"Pogledaj [prečace](#message-formatting) da saznaš o spojlerima, globalnim\n"
"vremenima i više.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Here are a few messages I understand: {bot_commands}\n"
"\n"
"Check out our [Getting started guide](/help/getting-started-with-zulip),\n"
"or browse the [help center](/help/) to learn more!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ovo su neke poruke koje razumijem: {bot_commands}\n"
"\n"
"Pogledaj naš [vodič za početak](/help/getting-started-with-zulip)\n"
"ili pregledaj [centar za pomoć](/help/) za više.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can chat with me as much as you like! To\n"
"get help, try one of the following messages: {bot_commands}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
